WEBVTT

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.910
Doesn't it feel good?

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.730
Ah... Ono-san.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:53.690
Geez.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.470
Young master! Did you call me?!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.510
It's time to close up.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.540
I-Is that so?

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.520
And what are you going to do now?

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.350
Wh-Wh-Wh-What do you mean, what am I going to do?

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.190
I mean...

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.580
I'm asking if you're going to watch me every day from outside the shop.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.110
Eh?

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:52.100
Why don't you work here instead?

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.270
I can't bear to see you lurking in front of the shop like a stalker.

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:02.970
Maybe your job will be to run errands, or run errands, or run errands...

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:07.270
I guess all you can do is run errands, but that's probably enough for you.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.850
Thank you very much, young master!

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.020
O-O-O-Ouch! You're hurting me, Chikage!

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:16.500
Oh! S-S-S-Sorry!

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.030
By the way, isn't your hand warm?

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:21.950
N-No.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.510
My heart feels like spring has just begun.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.410
Huh?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:36.090
Chikage-san is such a pure and honest man.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.470
So...

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:13.420
Starting tomorrow, maybe he can stay in a corner of the kitchen.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.550
Isn't he too big to keep in a corner?

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:17.940
Nice to meet you.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.460
Thank you, and be nice to him.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.630
Of course.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.370
Master, didn't I tell you?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.540
Chikage-san is straight.

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.940
Come on, I know!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.500
I'll just be nice, like Tachibana told me to.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.340
I won't make a play for him.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.110
But he really is cool.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.980
I thought you were wearing sunglasses to hide your embarrassment.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:24.400
My eyes are weak, so I have to wear them.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.740
Then, you don't need to wear them at night, do you?

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.850
B-But it's embarrassing.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.040
I knew it. It really was to hide your embarrassment.

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:42.890
It's true...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.640
Your eyes are really light-colored.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:47.070
Cute...

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.080
P-Please give them back to me!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.740
No.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.680
He's being played. He's being played!

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.760
He doesn't look like he's just drinking water.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.360
He's like a man in a picture...

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.480
Ono-san.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.990
Y-Yes. What is it?

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.330
I'm sorry...

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.260
I'd like to stay till tomorrow morning,

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:06.910
but I cannot let the young master have nightmares.

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.940
Huh?

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:17.510
I've been worried about that since he left his parents' house.

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.370
I have to get back to him as soon as possible.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:27.630
Ono-san!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.000
I seem to be tipsy.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.090
Are you all right?

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.730
I'm fine.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:44.130
There's a hotel near here. If I get some rest there...

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.170
Here he goes. That's Yu-chan!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.730
I see.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.830
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.480
Please forgive me!

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.190
Never mind, Chikage-san.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.830
I'm sorry.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.860
What was I about to do to you, even though you're tipsy?

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.530
I don't even understand myself!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:46.040
Umm... I think I'm the one who's tempting you.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.090
I wanted to kiss you so much!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:52.010
No, I was thinking of going further...

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:56.100
If I stay with you any more, I don't know what I'll do to you!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.670
So I think I'd better not see you again!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.470
Good-bye!

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.220
Eh? Umm...

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.820
Chikage-san!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:03.120
Ouch!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.200
Are you that worried about Tachibana?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:18.640
Tachibana needs you so much.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.860
It makes me want to puke!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.790
Die, you homo!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.010
Young master!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:39.160
Sorry for being late.

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.980
You weren't lonely, were you?

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.100
Come on.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.970
How old do you think I am?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:47.010
I'll prepare your usual cocoa right now.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:47.650
Eh?

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:51.750
Didn't I tell you that I hate cocoa?

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.650
I thought you knew me better.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.890
I don't understand any of it!

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.630
You're still here?

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:23.850
Sensei!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.310
I'm impressed that you're practicing.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.690
I still can't make anything...

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.820
and I haven't made this shop the world's best yet.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.830
Darling?

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:49.210
Isn't it time we went to bed?

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:50.790
Yeah.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:59.410
By the way, the pudding I took to the tea party today was very tasty.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.980
Maybe you should try some tomorrow.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.020
It's from a shop that opened recently.

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:05.810
Yeah.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:19.520
I don't remember anything.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.340
Good morning.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.490
G-G-Good morning.

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:39.510
Chikage-san, here...

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.510
Th-Thank you.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.020
How can you do this to me, Yu-chan!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.520
Yacchan?!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.410
I heard that you took another man to the Lollipop!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.400
No way! Master wouldn't talk about—

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.950
There you go!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.270
I heard it from another regular.

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:02.990
I heard the guy was tall, handsome, in a good suit, and wearing sunglasses!

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.730
This must be the guy!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:10.380
You really are cheating on me!

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:11.970
How can you say that...

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.350
We were just having a drink at the bar.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.710
I didn't really do anything with him.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.380
Really?

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:22.670
Really!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.680
There's nothing between us, is there, Chikage-san?

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:27.740
Nothing...

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.340
Eh?

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.660
Because we still haven't kissed,

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:32.890
there really was nothing...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.000
Nothing...

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.210
Cute...

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.200
Hey, Chikage-san.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.250
Hey, Ono!

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:12.720
I'm sorry.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.300
I'm not apologizing for hitting you.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:19.980
I said rude things to you in high school, right?

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.190
I'm sorry about that.

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:22.650
Die!

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:28.710
So you should apologize to Chikage, too.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:30.530
What you said just now wasn't fair!

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:34.860
Eiji!

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.870
Prepare to open the shop!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.510
Display all the cakes!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:39.630
Y-Yeah, right away.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.950
And you, mustache-man.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:43.280
Y-Yes!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:46.390
Go settle your problem with "the devilish gay."

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.050
What?

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.600
And Ono...

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.600
Chikage should be at my apartment.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.910
I'll get a drink somewhere after work, so you can drop in.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.550
I said rude things to you in high school, right?

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:30.580
So Tachibana's apartment is really close to the shop.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.560
I didn't know.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:34.780
Ono-san...

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:47.790
Ono-san, didn't we have a real conversation?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.210
Yeah.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:55.490
Didn't we spin around together in the rain?

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:56.760
Yeah.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:05.410
So you can't say there was nothing, right?

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.290
Yes, I think so.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:12.900
We went out together.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:16.890
We almost kissed.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.840
It's all right...

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.850
I was the one who was being serious.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.600
I'm really sorry, Chikage-san.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.100
I'm sorry.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.070
I broke up with Yacchan recently.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.450
It'd be easy to take advantage of you now,

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.460
but I can't do it.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:47.850
You're too good for a brute like me, Chikage-san.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.610
I'm sorry, Chikage-san.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:58.910
Ono-san.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:11.540
I made it.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.850
I made it, young master!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:14.780
I made it!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.240
No!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.700
You've tied your apron in a granny knot, you idiot.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.160
There.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.170
Ono!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.090
Eiji!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:27.800
What?

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.600
How does he look?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:43.490
H-He's so cool that I want to ravish him.

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:46.260
Gramps, you bought a new apron.

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:48.210
Yes! I have the same one as the young master!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.030
Well, I didn't think he could be a pâtissier,

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.580
so I'm trying him as a garçon.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.520
Ono-san.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:55.910
Y-Yes!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:00.410
I'm glad to be able to work as your junior.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.410
I'm glad too.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.220
But...

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:20.790
Somehow, this shop is getting less and less like a cake shop.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.680
Excuse me.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.140
Yes, I'm coming.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.610
Welcome.
Welcome.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:28.810
Wow.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.830
He's a bit scary, but so cool...

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.160
Why sunglasses?

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.790
But he's cool.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.610
U-Umm...

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.930
What's this Jean-Pierre?

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:46.080
It's pistachio brûlée and chocolate mousse with nuts,
covered with smooth chocolate ganache.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:52.480
The brightness of the chocolate makes this mellow, gorgeous product our star.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.050
I'll take it!
I'll take it!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.080
Right away, ladies.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.820
Thank you for waiting.

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.070
Thank you.

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.480
We await your next visit.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.840
Thank you very much.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.440
I want to know about this Cassis.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.450
Yes, sir.

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:18.110
This is our new product of the month.

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:29.790
It's a special sweet-and-sour cassis mousse on a sponge cake of rich caramel and figs.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.090
Aren't you...

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.210
Tachibana Keiichirou-kun?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.890
Please...

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.650
Please... rescue my son.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.570
Please, somehow...

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:53.810
We'll definitely rescue Keiichirou-kun.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:54.820
Please!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.890
Rescue our son!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.370
Please...

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.910
Please, somehow.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.940
Please!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.780
Yes.

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:10.960
We found the child!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.490
He has blood on his shirt!

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.500
But he seems to be okay!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.340
Your hair is all messy.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.760
Did you sleep well last night?

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:29.670
Well, Keiichirou-kun, please tell me whatever you remember about the person who kidnapped you.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:32.250
You can tell onee-san.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:40.550
I really don't remember anything.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:46.620
I don't remember anything from the moment I was kidnapped until I was brought to the hospital.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:55.540
I'm sorry that I couldn't help with the investigation.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.530
I've been looking for you.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:03.210
I don't know how to apologize to you.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.630
You don't have to.

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.630
The police did what they could.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.430
It's true you didn't arrest the kidnapper,

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:15.410
but the kidnapped child was rescued.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:20.100
And 23 years later, he's running a cake shop like this.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.580
I think that's enough.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:30.330
But I hope this won't be your last visit to our shop to buy cakes.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:31.710
Well, Cassis—

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.620
Why a cake shop?

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.650
Keiichirou-kun, why are you running a cake shop?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.470
I remember one thing.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:21:00.350
I remember one thing about the man who kidnapped me.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:09.320
He liked cake, and every day he forced me to eat the cake he bought.
